  data: {
    LLM: 'Swap high-value cards (Aces, 2s, 10s) to your face-up Table cards. They are your lifeline for the endgame. Avoid picking up a large pile early on.\n\nIf you are forced to pick up a pile, try to do it when it contains many cards of the same rank, allowing you to play them all at once later.\n\nCard Counting: Keep track of the 2s and 10s. If your opponent is on their blind cards and you know all the 10s are gone, you can block them with a high King or Ace safely.',
    Player: 'Swap high-value cards (Aces, 2s, 10s) to your face-up Table cards. They are your lifeline for the endgame. Avoid picking up a large pile early on.\n\nIf you are forced to pick up a pile, try to do it when it contains many cards of the same rank, allowing you to play them all at once later.\n\nCard Counting: Keep track of the 2s and 10s. If your opponent is on their blind cards and you know all the 10s are gone, you can block them with a high King or Ace safely.',
